{"type":"message","id":"8e52aefa","parentId":"184120af","timestamp":"2026-03-19T08:05:33.773Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"มี Claude Code อยู่แล้ว! กู spawn ให้เลย 🦞"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01Ca7usdSeDpibQFBwYMdYz6","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd C:\\Users\\hp\\Projects\\dashboard; claude --permission-mode bypassPermissions --print \"Create a modern trading/business dashboard using Next.js 14 with Tailwind CSS and shadcn/ui. The dashboard should include:\n\n1. A top navbar with the title 'Dashboard' and a dark/light mode toggle\n2. KPI cards showing: Portfolio Value, Daily P&L, Win Rate, Total Trades\n3. A line chart showing mock portfolio performance over 30 days (use recharts)\n4. A table showing mock stock positions (symbol, qty, avg price, current price, P&L %)\n5. A small news/alerts panel on the side\n\nUse mock data (no external API needed). Make it look professional and modern.\n\nStack:\n- Next.js 14 (app router)\n- Tailwind CSS\n- shadcn/ui components\n- recharts for charts\n\nInitialize the project with: npx create-next-app@latest . --typescript --tailwind --eslint --app --no-src-dir --import-alias '@/*' --yes\nThen install dependencies and build the dashboard.\n\nWhen completely finished, run: openclaw system event --text 'Done: Trading dashboard built at C:/Users/hp/Projects/dashboard' --mode now\"","workdir":"C:\\Users\\hp\\Projects\\dashboard","background":true,"timeout":300}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","usage":{"input":1,"output":428,"cacheRead":22517,"cacheWrite":195,"totalTokens":23141,"cost":{"input":0.000003,"output":0.00642,"cacheRead":0.0067551,"cacheWrite":0.00073125,"total":0.013909350000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773907523247}}
