{"type":"message","id":"76669373","parentId":"22601ce7","timestamp":"2026-03-19T08:24:21.518Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to expand the dashboard with multiple tabs:\n1. หุ้น (Stocks)\n2. ทอง/Forex (Gold/Forex for short-term trading)\n3. รายรับ-รายจ่าย (Income/Expense tracking)\n4. ข่าว (News affecting them)\n\nThis is a significant coding task. Let me spawn a coding agent (Claude Code) to build this out properly, or I can write it myself since I know the structure already. Given the complexity, let me write it myself - it'll be faster and more reliable than spawning an agent that might timeout again.\n\n\nI'll structure this as separate components for each tab with a main navigation system, using recharts for visualizations and mock data throughout. I'm planning to create the main page with tab switching, then individual components for stocks, forex, expenses, and news sections.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"โอเค งานนี้ใหญ่หน่อย กูเขียนให้เองเลย สร้างเป็น component แยกๆ ให้สวยงาม!"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01CFHtamBuzjjnufVUS8RxR3","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\hp\\Projects\\dashboard\\components\\StocksTab.tsx","content":"\"use client\";\nimport { LineChart, Line, XAxis, YAxis, CartesianGrid, Tooltip, ResponsiveContainer } from \"recharts\";\nimport { TrendingUp, TrendingDown, DollarSign, BarChart2 } from \"lucide-react\";\n\nconst portfolioData = Array.from({ length: 30 }, (_, i) => ({\n  day: `${i + 1}`,\n  value: 100000 + Math.floor(Math.sin(i / 3) * 8000 + i * 300 + Math.random() * 2000),\n}));\n\nconst positions = [\n  { symbol: \"NVDA\", qty: 50, avgPrice: 820, currentPrice: 950, sector: \"Tech\" },\n  { symbol: \"AAPL\", qty: 100, avgPrice: 175, currentPrice: 169, sector: \"Tech\" },\n  { symbol: \"PTT.BK\", qty: 5000, avgPrice: 32, currentPrice: 35.5, sector: \"Energy\" },\n  { symbol: \"TSLA\", qty: 30, avgPrice: 250, currentPrice: 178, sector: \"EV\" },\n  { symbol: \"BTC\", qty: 0.5, avgPrice: 55000, currentPrice: 68000, sector: \"Crypto\" },\n];\n\nconst kpis = [\n  { label: \"Portfolio Value\", value: \"฿2,847,500\", change: \"+12.4%\", up: true, icon: DollarSign },\n  { label: \"Daily P&L\", value: \"+฿18,200\", change: \"+0.64%\", up: true, icon: TrendingUp },\n  { label: \"Win Rate\", value: \"67.3%\", change: \"+2.1% this month\", up: true, icon: BarChart2 },\n  { label: \"Open Positions\", value: \"5\", change: \"3 in profit\", up: true, icon: TrendingDown },\n];\n\nexport default function StocksTab() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"space-y-6\">\n      <div className=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4\">\n        {kpis.map((k) => (\n          <div key={k.label} className=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800\">\n            <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2\">\n              <span className=\"text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400\">{k.label}</span>\n              <k.icon size={18} className=\"text-gray-400\" />\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"text-2xl font-bold\">{k.value}</div>\n            <div className={`text-sm mt-1 ${k.up ? \"text-green-500\" : \"text-red-500\"}`}>{k.change}</div>\n          </div>\n        ))}\n      </div>\n\n      <div className=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800\">\n        <h2 className=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4\">Portfolio Performance (30d)</h2>\n        <ResponsiveContainer width=\"100%\" height={220}>\n          <LineChart data={portfolioData}>\n            <CartesianGrid strokeDasharray=\"3 3\" stroke=\"#f0f0f0\" />\n            <XAxis dataKey=\"day\" tick={{ fontSize: 11 }} stroke=\"#9ca3af\" />\n            <YAxis tick={{ fontSize: 11 }} stroke=\"#9ca3af\" tickFormatter={(v) => `฿${(v / 1000).toFixed(0)}k`} />\n            <Tooltip formatter={(v: number) => [`฿${v.toLocaleString()}`, \"Value\"]} />\n            <Line type=\"monotone\" dataKey=\"value\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" strokeWidth={2} dot={false} />\n          </LineChart>\n        </ResponsiveContainer>\n      </div>\n\n      <div className=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800\">\n        <h2 className=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4\">📊 Open Positions</h2>\n        <div className=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n          <table className=\"w-full text-sm\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr className=\"text-left text-gray-400 border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800\">\n                <th className=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Symbol</th>\n                <th className=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Sector</th>\n                <th className=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Qty</th>\n                <th className=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Avg Price</th>\n                <th className=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Current</th>\n                <th className=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">P&L %</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              {positions.map((p) => {\n                const pnl = ((p.currentPrice - p.avgPrice) / p.avgPrice) * 100;\n                return (\n                  <tr key={p.symbol} className=\"border-b border-gray-50 dark:border-gray-800 hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-800/50\">\n                    <td className=\"py-3 font-semibold\">{p.symbol}</td>\n                    <td className=\"py-3 text-gray-400\">{p.sector}</td>\n                    <td className=\"py-3 text-right\">{p.qty.toLocaleString()}</td>\n                    <td className=\"py-3 text-right\">{p.avgPrice.toLocaleString()}</td>\n                    <td className=\"py-3 text-right\">{p.currentPrice.toLocaleString()}</td>\n                    <td className={`py-3 text-right font-semibold ${pnl >= 0 ? \"text-green-500\" : \"text-red-500\"}`}>\n                      {pnl >= 0 ? \"+\" : \"\"}{pnl.toFixed(2)}%\n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                );\n              })}\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","usage":{"input":3,"output":2251,"cacheRead":31850,"cacheWrite":432,"totalTokens":34536,"cost":{"input":0.000009,"output":0.033765,"cacheRead":0.009555,"cacheWrite":0.0016200000000000001,"total":0.04494900000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773908630462}}
