{"type":"message","id":"d82324d7","parentId":"2a6caede","timestamp":"2026-03-19T08:29:54.941Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✅ **Compile สำเร็จ!** ตอนนี้มี 6 tab แล้ว:\n\n- 📈 หุ้น\n- 🥇 ทอง / Forex\n- 💰 รายรับ-รายจ่าย\n- 📰 ข่าวการเงิน\n- 💻 **ข่าวเทค** ← ใหม่! (AI, Apple, Nvidia, Neuralink ฯลฯ)\n- 🌍 **เปลี่ยนโลก** ← ใหม่! (AGI, ฟิวชัน, BRICS, SpaceX ฯลฯ)\n\nเปิดดูได้เลย → **http://localhost:3000** 🦞"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","usage":{"input":1,"output":222,"cacheRead":49863,"cacheWrite":246,"totalTokens":50332,"cost":{"input":0.000003,"output":0.00333,"cacheRead":0.014958899999999999,"cacheWrite":0.0009225,"total":0.0192144}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773908988800}}
