{"type":"message","id":"c8728884","parentId":"ab4439f6","timestamp":"2026-03-19T13:43:37.466Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if they can chat without internet. They're messaging from Telegram (or webchat) which requires internet to reach the OpenClaw gateway. But the question seems to be more of a surprised/curious observation rather than a technical question.\n\nActually, looking at the metadata, this is from \"openclaw-control-ui\" so it's webchat. The user seems surprised they can chat - maybe they thought they didn't have internet but the message went through anyway.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"ได้สิ แต่จริงๆ มึงมีเน็ตอยู่นะ ไม่งั้นข้อความมาไม่ถึงกูหรอก 😄\n\nที่มึงหมายถึงน่าจะคือ **ไม่ต้องเปิด browser เพิ่ม** — คุยผ่าน Telegram ได้เลยใช่มั้ย? อันนั้นใช่เลย สะดวกกว่าเยอะ 🦞"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","usage":{"input":3,"output":279,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":56678,"totalTokens":56960,"cost":{"input":0.000009,"output":0.004185,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.2125425,"total":0.2167365}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773927803677}}
