{"type":"message","id":"bb98f0e4","parentId":"bc8429de","timestamp":"2026-03-19T13:45:35.662Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is pointing out that they need to keep their computer on and the gateway running for OpenClaw to work. This is a valid point - OpenClaw runs locally on their machine, so if the computer is off or the gateway isn't running, it won't work.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"อ๋อ โทษที กูเข้าใจผิด! 😂\n\nใช่เลย มึงพูดถูก — **ต้องเปิดคอมทิ้งไว้ + gateway รันอยู่** ถึงจะคุยได้ นั่นคือข้อจำกัดของ OpenClaw แบบ local\n\nถ้าอยากให้กูออนไลน์ตลอด 24/7 โดยไม่ต้องเปิดคอม ต้องย้ายไปรันบน **VPS** แทน เช่น:\n- **DigitalOcean / Vultr** — เดือนละ ~$6\n- **Oracle Cloud Free Tier** — ฟรีตลอดชีพ\n\nอยากลอง migrate ขึ้น VPS มั้ย? 🦞"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","usage":{"input":3,"output":329,"cacheRead":56913,"cacheWrite":269,"totalTokens":57514,"cost":{"input":0.000009,"output":0.004935,"cacheRead":0.0170739,"cacheWrite":0.00100875,"total":0.02302665}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773927923108}}
