{"type":"message","id":"eae70a78","parentId":"1c16757d","timestamp":"2026-03-19T14:56:03.979Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The user doesn't want to use OpenRouter. This is an important constraint.\n\nSince OpenClaw doesn't directly support Google/Gemini and they don't want OpenRouter, the only remaining option to use Gemini is via LiteLLM as a proxy. I should suggest that.โอเค **ไม่ใช้ OpenRouter ก็ได้!**\n\nถ้าอย่างนั้นเราต้องใช้ **LiteLLM** มาเป็นตัวกลาง (proxy) ให้ Google Gemini API key ของมึง\n\n**ข้อดี:**\n- ใช้ Gemini ได้โดยตรง\n- ไม่ต้องพึ่ง third-party (OpenRouter)\n\n**ข้อเสีย:**\n- ต้อง config เพิ่มอีกนิดหน่อย\n\nมึงโอเคจะใช้ LiteLLM เป็นตัวกลางมั้ย? 🦞"}],"api":"google-generative-ai","provider":"google","model":"gemini-2.5-flash","usage":{"input":59322,"output":155,"cacheRead":58934,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":59477,"cost":{"input":0.0177966,"output":0.00038750000000000004,"cacheRead":0.00442005,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.022604149999999996}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773932156040}}
